  '- Hostility aimed at any OTHER person or institution - a rival politician, a president, an army, a party, a journalist, an unnamed group - is NOT Negative toward the author, even when the image is angry, accusatory, or insulting in tone. A reply that merely forwards someone else\'s accusation against a third party, and does not turn it on the author, is Neutral.',
